# Data Portfolio Cursor Rules (GrokBot Bridge)

1. **Architecture:** Next.js App Router (Static Export for Vercel), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS. No external database; all portfolio projects, experience, and metrics live in `/src/data/portfolioData.ts`.
2. **Task Contract Driven:** Before modifying components, check `/docs/contracts/` and `/docs/ui/brief.md` generated by GrokBots `@Roy` and `@Sam`.
3. **Path Governance:**
   - UI components go in `/src/components/`
   - Structured resume & project data go in `/src/data/`
   - Page routes go in `/src/app/`
4. **Data Accuracy Gate:** Never invent metrics. Use only verified metrics from `/src/data/portfolioData.ts` (DP-203, DP-600, DP-900, Martian Dynamics 8-agent DuckDB warehouse, Cloud IT Tec GCP Dataproc, Curi Databricks/MLflow, Midtown Consulting Fabric Synapse ML, UCF DARE).
5. **Component Style:** Dark-mode-first engineering aesthetic, clean architecture flow badges (Bronze -> Silver -> Gold Medallion layers), mobile-first responsive grids, zero layout shift.
